{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 15, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "先生", "id": "先生"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "官", "id": "官"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "小弁", "id": "小弁"}, {"form": "怨", "id": "怨"}, {"form": "懷", "id": "懷"}, {"form": "摟", "id": "摟"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "疏", "id": "疏"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "輕", "id": "輕"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "重", "id": "重"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.3381392456950185, "source": "親", "target": "小弁"}, {"weight": 3.3381392456950185, "source": "親", "target": "怨"}, {"weight": 2.239526957026909, "source": "親", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.114995694380809, "source": "親", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 2.0853762771996505, "source": "親", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.0504571732432377, "source": "輕", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.239526957026909, "source": "輕", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 2.644992065135073, "source": "輕", "target": "色"}, {"weight": 1.7976942047478695, "source": "輕", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.951844884575128, "source": "輕", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.441019260809137, "source": "輕", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.539631549477247, "source": "懷", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.0355541527009728, "source": "懷", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.3573099926832923, "source": "懷", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.932